        alt=""
        text="Balayage, highlights, lowlights, glossing. We will together figure out the perfect combo of the above opportunities for you and your hair.<br /><br />
If there is complications with old colours in your hair, i can be charging you an extra 500 kr. <br /><br />
Contact if you have any questions."
        prices={[
