    </div>

    <div class="service-item" data-category="straight">
      <ServiceCard
        title="Balayage/Colour sesh"
        image="/imgs/stock-img.png"
        alt="Image is on the way <33"
        text="Balayage, highlights, lowlights, glossing.
We will together figure out the perfect combo of the above opportunities for you and your hair.
If there is complications with old colours in your hair, i can be charging you an extra 500 kr.
Contact me if you have any questions <3"
        prices={[
          { label: "Short/In between", time: "210 min", price: "2800 kr" },
          {
            label: "Long and/or thick",
            time: "210 min",
            price: "3500 kr",
          },
        ]}
      />
    </div>

    <div class="service-item" data-category="straight">
      <ServiceCard
        title="Root colour + glossing"
        image="/imgs/stock-img.png"
        alt="Image is on the way <33"
        text="Root colour is primarily for coverage of grey hair. DON'T choose this if you want balayage or highlights!
If you are confused about what to choose, you are more than welcome to contact me <3"
        prices={[
          { label: "Short/In between", time: "150 min", price: "2000 kr" },
          {
            label: "Long and/or thick",
            time: "150 min",
