          },
        ]}
      />
    </div>

    <div class="service-item" data-category="straight">
      <ServiceCard
        title="Root colour + straight cut"
        image="/imgs/stock-img.png"
        alt="Image is on the way <33"
        text="Root colour is primarily for coverage of grey hair. DON'T choose this if you want balayage or highlights!
If you are confused about what to choose, you are more than welcome to contact me <3"
        prices={[
          { label: "Short/In between", time: "135 min", price: "2000 kr" },
          {
            label: "Long and/or thick",
            time: "165 min",
            price: "2500 kr",
          },
        ]}
      />
    </div>

    <div class="service-item" data-category="straight">
      <ServiceCard
        title="From blonde to brown"
        image="/imgs/stock-img.png"
        alt="Image is on the way <33"
        text="When it comes to transitioning from blonde to brown, there are numerous approaches to consider. Rest assured, we will work together to determine the best method for achieving your desired look.
Methods to be used:
- Reverse balayage
- Lowlights
- Glossing
- Root shade"
        prices={[
          { label: "Short/In between", time: "150 min", price: "2500 kr" },
          {
            label: "Long and/or thick",
